1p4b|n|Any of the smaller species of the genus Lepus, especially the common European species (Lepus cuniculus), which is often kept as a pet, and has been introduced into many countries. It is remarkably prolific, and has become a pest in some parts of Australia and New Zealand.	n:mjh,45,2~mjh,45,2	N:yx1,88,7;yx0,88,8~yx0,88,8;yx1,88,7
