1piz|n|The relation which one quantity or magnitude has to another of the same kind. It is expressed by the quotient of the division of the first by the second; thus, the ratio of 3 to 6 is expressed by / or /; of a to b by a/b; or (less commonly) the second term is made the dividend; as, a:b = b/a. ; Hence, fixed relation of number, quantity, or degree; rate; proportion; as, the ratio of representation in Congress.	a:v1q,62,11;v4r,42,1;ymm,33,6;129n,25,2~v1q,62,11;ymm,33,6;129n,25,2;v4r,42,1	v:v1t,75,1;1sjv,73,1;1bav,63,3;rai,46,3;v1q,37,2;1bbk,6,2~rai,46,3;1bav,63,3;v1q,37,2;1bbk,6,2;1sjv,73,1;v1t,75,1	n:2526,97,4;1q76,85,10;29mj,64,9;v1q,62,11;4zt,55,3;v4r,52,2;rao,46,11;t0o,37,3;xyt,36,5;129n,31,3;1ovy,15,10~rao,46,11;v1q,62,11;1q76,85,10;1ovy,15,10;29mj,64,9;xyt,36,5;2526,97,4;4zt,55,3;129n,31,3;t0o,37,3;v4r,52,2
